" ❯ shift+tab     cycle permission mode                                                             default  "
"   /             commands, in this list                                                                     "
"   ?             keys, in this list                                                                         "
"   ctrl+r        choose resume                                                                              "
"   esc           sheet → card → dropdown → pane → search → interrupt → clear → latest → back → rewind →…    "
"   ctrl+o        expand result · then all                                                                   "
"   ctrl+t        tasks band on and off                                                                      "
"   ctrl+c        stop · clear · twice exits                                                                 "
"   1-9 · y/a/n   answer the open dialog                                                                     "
"   alt+b/f       move one word                                                                              "
"   alt+p         cycle pane place                                                                           "
"   click         a picture · open it                                                                        "
"   ctrl+a/e      line start/end (home · end)                                                                "
"   ctrl+b        background running command                                                                 "
